<section class="mission-page">
  <div class="mission-header">
    <img src="../assets/footprint.png" class="mission-badge" alt="Digital Footprint Defender Badge">
    <div>
      <p class="tag">Mission 4</p>
      <h1>Digital Footprint Defender</h1>
      <p class="mission-intro">Make the right imprint online.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson-box">
    <h2>Step 1: Learn</h2>
    <p>A digital footprint is the trail of data you leave behind every time you use the internet.</p>
    <p>Your digital footprint is like a permanent record. It shows who you are, what you value, and how you treat others.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson-box">
    <h2>Step 2: Think Before You Post</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Would I be okay if my parents saw this?</li>
      <li>Would a future college be okay with this?</li>
      <li>Would an employer be okay with this?</li>
      <li>Would I be okay if this was shared or screenshotted?</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson-box">
    <h2>Step 3: Post or Delete?</h2>
    <p>A picture in front of your school with the caption: “Another long day at Bates Academy.”</p>
    <button onclick="showResult('footprintResult', false)">Post</button>
    <button onclick="showResult('footprintResult', true)">Delete</button>
    <p id="footprintResult" class="result-text"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson-box center">
    <h2>Mission Complete</h2>
    <a class="button" href="../index.html#missions">Back to Missions</a>
  </div>
</section>

